@title Cabinet: box select three devices, drag them together, undo and redo restore the whole group
@area Cabinet
@sizes 1366x768
# Box select (drag on empty plate) takes F1, F2 and F3 of the lesson cabinet. A drag on one of them
# carries all three. One undo puts all three back, one redo moves all three again.
open qa/fixtures/cabinet-lesson.novo
wait 30
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 30
move 300 600
shot before
check_layout
drag 735 158 600 243
wait 15
move 300 600
wait 5
expect "Align"
expect "3 selected"
expect "55, 10 mm"
shot box-selected
drag 670 208 770 488
wait 20
move 300 600
wait 5
expect_not "55, 10 mm"
shot group-dragged
check_layout
click 509 29
wait 15
move 300 600
wait 5
expect "55, 10 mm"
shot undone-whole-group
click 557 29
wait 15
move 300 600
wait 5
expect_not "55, 10 mm"
shot redone-whole-group
